    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_argocd",
      "x": 956,
      "y": 96,
      "width": 468,
      "height": 188,
      "text": "argocd  [VPN only]\n──────────────────────────────────\nArgo CD  (GitOps engine)\nargocd.company.com  (VPN only)\n\nPolls GitOps repo every ~3 min\nSyncs Git state → k3s\npruneResources: true\nselfHeal: configurable per app",
